Brand design system, source files and logo: Tunisiska Services project supplied by the user. The films use its navy/orange/neutral tokens, Rubik type, card/radius system and motion guidance. The logo is the only bitmap visual and is not an app screenshot.

Font: Rubik Project Authors, SIL Open Font License 1.1. Original bundled font files and the OFL license text are included in assets/fonts/.

Motion/rendering guide: Lemo-Opuscar, MIT License, https://github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar. Pictogram Motion contributes only broad motion-design principles; its demo art, story and audio are not used.

All vehicles, route graphics, service pictograms, card modules, backgrounds, score and sound effects are original code or procedural audio made for this film. App screenshots were analyzed as references but are not present in the project or video. No screen recordings, stock imagery, map data, third-party music or sample libraries are used.
